# Benchmark design notes
Date: 2026-10-29. Prime notes before the design.
The Director proposed a separate Codex bench coordinator receiving work as a Colab,
running baseline and compute-assisted forms and returning comparisons in N7NN.
The coordinator must not solve both conditions in the same context. Fresh evaluated
sessions need equal source access, fixed criteria and matched variants. No live
assignment, held app fixture, paid model call or session dispatch is authorized by
the harness build. Measure accepted outcomes and correction/attention cost, not only
speed or tokens. All points integrated into the design and implementation pack.
